# Day 2 (Sunday) - Begin cleaning the restaurant and meet Lucy
label event_main_2:

# Day 2 (Dawn) - ???

    scene img_main2_1 with fade
    MCi "（啊，我睡得真好！真是运气好，这地方被留下时状况不错。）"
    scene img_main2_2 with dissolve
    "你一点没在床上赖着，而是决定跳过早餐，直接去打扫楼上的厨房。"
    scene img_main2_3 with dissolve
    MCi "（好了，干活吧。这地方又不会自己变干净。）"

    play sound [ "<silence 0.6>", "audio/sounds/cleaning_spray.mp3" ]

    scene img_main2_4 with fade
    pause

    play sound "audio/sounds/cleaning_wipe.mp3" volume 3.0

    scene img_main2_5 with dissolve
    pause
    scene img_main2_6 with dissolve
    "幸好前任主人把它照顾得很好，所以只要你稍加努力，就把这里收拾得跟新的一样。"

    # Advance Time
    $ CurrentTime += 1
    $ TimeOutput = Time[CurrentTime]

# Day 2 (Morning) - ???

    scene img_main2_7 with fade
    "等你收拾完，已经到了午饭时间。不过因为一想到咖啡馆要开业就兴奋难当，你连午饭也打算跳过了。"
    scene img_common_11 with dissolve
    MCi "（我好像有点太投入了，反正又不是明天就开业。）"
    scene img_common_12 with dissolve
    MCi "（但我为这一天梦想太久了，既然人已经到了，就只想赶紧干活。）"
    scene img_main2_8 with fade
    MCi "（我还是不敢相信这么大的厨房是我的！）"

    play sound [ "<silence 0.6>", "audio/sounds/cleaning_spray.mp3" ]

    scene img_main2_9 with fade
    "你开始勤勤恳恳地清除多年废弃积下的灰尘与蛛网。"

    # Advance Time
    $ CurrentTime += 1
    $ TimeOutput = Time[CurrentTime]

# Day 2 (Afternoon) - ???

    #zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz
    scene img_main2_10 with fade

    play sound [ "<silence 0.6>", "audio/sounds/cleaning_wipe.mp3" ] volume 3.0

    "没过多久，你就完全沉浸在这项单调的工作里了。"

    play music "audio/bgm/lucy_theme.mp3" loop volume 1.2 fadeout 1.0 fadein 1.0

    scene img_main2_11 with fade
    scene img_main2_11 with vpunch
    LucyWho "呃……你、你是谁？"
    scene img_main2_12 with dissolve
    MC "嗯？"
    scene img_main2_13 with dissolve
    MC "我是个有清洁癖的非法闯入者。"
    scene img_main2_14 with dissolve
    LucyWho "不、不会吧……"
    MC "没错，我甚至还带着清洁用品作证呢。"
    scene img_main2_15 with dissolve
    LucyWho "变、变态？"
    MC "..."
    MC "我开玩笑的。我是这个地方的新主人。你是谁？"
    scene img_main2_16 with dissolve
    LucyWho "啊……我、我是呃……真的非常抱歉！请不要生气……"
    MC "我为什么要生气？"
    scene img_main2_17 with dissolve
    LucyWho "呃……那、那个，我没经过允许就进来了……还、还叫你变态……"
    MC "没关系，我被骂过比这难听得多。话说，你叫什么名字？"
    scene img_main2_18 with dissolve
    Lucy "露、露西……"
    MC "那露西，你来这里做什么？"
    scene img_main2_19 with dissolve
    Lucy "啊……呃……这里平时应该是空的……"
    MC "这可不算回答。一直给这些花浇水的人是你吗？"
    scene img_main2_16 with dissolve
    Lucy "是、是的……对不起……"
    MC "你不用这么紧张，我真没生气。"
    scene img_main2_17 with dissolve
    Lucy "真的吗？"
    MC "真的。"
    scene img_main2_16 with dissolve
    Lucy "呃……那我先走了……"
    scene img_main2_20 with dissolve
    scene img_main2_20 with hpunch
    "咕噜噜噜噜噜噜噜噜噜噜噜噜噜噜噜！"
    scene img_main2_21 with dissolve
    Lucy "啊……我、我……"
    MC "听起来你饿了。"
    scene img_main2_22 with dissolve
    Lucy "不、不是我不……"
    MC "我也是，我一整天都没吃东西。"
    Lucy "哦……"
    MC "我昨晚才刚搬过来，所以其实什么食材都没有。"
    MC "这倒让我有个主意。"
    MC "露西，你知道附近的商店在哪儿吗？"
    scene img_main2_21 with dissolve
    Lucy "呃，有一家在……"
    MC "这样吧，我给你写张单子。"
    scene img_main2_22 with dissolve
    Lucy "..."
    scene img_main2_23 with dissolve
    "你飞快地把一张食材清单写好，交给一脸茫然的女孩。"
    scene img_main2_24 with dissolve
    "写完以后，你把纸条对折，连同一些钱一起递给她。"
    MC "给，这些应该够我们用的了。"
    scene img_main2_25 with dissolve
    Lucy "哦，好、好的……？"
    scene img_main2_26 with dissolve
    "露西一脸茫然地离开了。"

    $ persistent.characters_lucy = True

    # Advance Time
    $ CurrentTime += 1
    $ TimeOutput = Time[CurrentTime]

